 r←Test_Cleanup_017(debugFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;T2;rc;log
⍝ Exercise `Run` with an ungrouped test case: no group-specific `Cleanup_` must be looked for or executed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 #.⎕SHADOW'Temp'
 'Temp'#.⎕NS''
 T2←⎕NEW ##.Tester2 #.Temp
 #.Temp.⎕FX'r←Test_01 x;⎕TRAP' 'r←0'
 #.Temp.⎕FX'Cleanup_' '∆CleanupWithoutGroup←1'
 (rc log)←T2.Run 1
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf(⊂'*** WARNING: function "#.Temp.Cleanup_" will never be executed: the group name is missing')∊log
 →T.PassesIf 0=#.Temp.⎕NC'∆CleanupWithoutGroup'

 r←T._OK
